=== PART 5. ESTIMATOR 5: COVERAGE ===
horizontal 5x10 cells sampled: 467
depth bins per sampled column, median 8.0 (max 17)

WHAT THIS CANNOT SAY, and it is a real gap: the DENOMINATOR -- how many
5x10 cells contain ocean deeper than 2627 m -- needs bathymetry this repo
does not carry. So coverage is reported as a count, not a fraction, and
the unsampled-volume contribution to Var(xbar_w) is NOT in any number
above. It would push n_eff DOWN.


